      "value": "@{69d4f668a4b6d376ad240d8f|full_name}\n\n- HTTP 429: Your IP-address has been blocked by YouTube, nothing to be done. This isn't a yt-dlp issue. Datacenter / VPN IP-addresses get frequently throttled / blocked.\n\n- Nicovideo doesn't provide muxed formats for AVPro Video / Unity Video player, thus this playback is unsupported in VRChat. This is also the case with upstream yt-dlp 2026.03.17.",
