  "details": "Video player shows \"loading\" then \"video loading error\" then \"retry\" - tested in a few video player worlds, all having video loading errors. I usually load youtube videos and tested nicovideo before. Sometimes it does play for 10 - 20min, but then it will stop loading and keep triggering the error message. \n\nI notice that not everyone in the same world has the same issue - seems like it is triggering for me mostly. Previously shortly after the yt-dlp fix, I can load without issue. But this issue has lasted since last week.",
